ause there's going to be people out  there who wants to hurt him it's over  but  there's another chapter in our lives as  those cries for justice reform continue  to grow louder the written house family  tells me they're looking into pursuing  legal action  against people who they believe  slandered kyle rittenhouse arthel alexis  mcadams thank you hey sean hannity here  hey click here to subscribe to fox news  youtube page and catch our hottest  interviews and most compelling analysis  you will not get it anywhere else
 

